    "detailed_description": "<h1>PROJECT WARLOCK II 1.0 OUT NOW</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163020/extras/d1f4a19c2219d3f862f13572d6c1224f.avif?t=1754581065\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully aim your repeater pistol at a huge mosquito and down the bulging insect with two well-placed shots, jump down the ledge of a dilapidated building reclaimed by arborescent vegetation, dodge acidic slime thrown by a hideous mutant, and bury a blood-red fire axe in its disgusting head. This is the adrenaline-fueled thrill of <strong>The Looter</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163020/extras/95bfd4f94f5d5bab4752dae4a300dd11.poster.avif?t=1754581065\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163020/extras/95bfd4f94f5d5bab4752dae4a300dd11.webm?t=1754581065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163020/extras/95bfd4f94f5d5bab4752dae4a300dd11.mp4?t=1754581065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lone scavenger is sent on a dangerous mission to the legendary <strong>Monastyr</strong>. The journey takes them deep into <strong>Tortura</strong>, a vast, post-apocalyptic land where twisted forests and desolate deserts hide the decaying monuments of a past civilization. To survive, they must fight ruthless creatures and uncover dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163020/extras/440ad872efa2050d6ad4ec636fa6ce09.poster.avif?t=1754581065\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163020/extras/440ad872efa2050d6ad4ec636fa6ce09.webm?t=1754581065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163020/extras/440ad872efa2050d6ad4ec636fa6ce09.mp4?t=1754581065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense Combat:</strong> Master a variety of firearms like pistols, shotguns, and assault rifles with a full 360-degree aiming system. When enemies get too close, your trusty fire axe is a last resort, backed up by grenades and landmines to ensure your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Navigate the vast, somber landscape of <strong>Tortura</strong>. Search overgrown ruins, deserted bunkers, and empty bases to uncover valuable loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Secrets:</strong> Be perceptive to uncover every secret the world keeps from you. Unearth lore, find hidden places, and discover artifacts that will aid your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot &amp; Crafting:</strong> Find artifacts and materials to combine and craft into new tools and equipment. Tailor your gear to your playstyle as you discover new blueprints and recipes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Compelling Story:</strong> Face dangerous strangers and ruthless creatures on your adventure. Uncover the tragic history of Tortura and the great evil lurking in the shadows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully aim your repeater pistol at a huge mosquito and down the bulging insect with two well-placed shots, jump down the ledge of a dilapidated building reclaimed by arborescent vegetation, dodge acidic slime thrown by a hideous mutant, and bury a blood-red fire axe in its disgusting head. This is the adrenaline-fueled thrill of <strong>The Looter</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163020/extras/95bfd4f94f5d5bab4752dae4a300dd11.poster.avif?t=1754581065\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163020/extras/95bfd4f94f5d5bab4752dae4a300dd11.webm?t=1754581065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163020/extras/95bfd4f94f5d5bab4752dae4a300dd11.mp4?t=1754581065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lone scavenger is sent on a dangerous mission to the legendary <strong>Monastyr</strong>. The journey takes them deep into <strong>Tortura</strong>, a vast, post-apocalyptic land where twisted forests and desolate deserts hide the decaying monuments of a past civilization. To survive, they must fight ruthless creatures and uncover dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163020/extras/440ad872efa2050d6ad4ec636fa6ce09.poster.avif?t=1754581065\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163020/extras/440ad872efa2050d6ad4ec636fa6ce09.webm?t=1754581065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1163020/extras/440ad872efa2050d6ad4ec636fa6ce09.mp4?t=1754581065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense Combat:</strong> Master a variety of firearms like pistols, shotguns, and assault rifles with a full 360-degree aiming system. When enemies get too close, your trusty fire axe is a last resort, backed up by grenades and landmines to ensure your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Navigate the vast, somber landscape of <strong>Tortura</strong>. Search overgrown ruins, deserted bunkers, and empty bases to uncover valuable loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Secrets:</strong> Be perceptive to uncover every secret the world keeps from you. Unearth lore, find hidden places, and discover artifacts that will aid your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot &amp; Crafting:</strong> Find artifacts and materials to combine and craft into new tools and equipment. Tailor your gear to your playstyle as you discover new blueprints and recipes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Compelling Story:</strong> Face dangerous strangers and ruthless creatures on your adventure. Uncover the tragic history of Tortura and the great evil lurking in the shadows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "The post-apocalyptic land of Tortura is a decaying world of overgrown ruins that devoured the last traces of humanity. In The Looter, a lone scavenger navigates its depths, facing mutated animals, vile abominations, and dangerous strangers. Uncovering hidden secrets is key to survival.",
